.PS
# Berkeley's mos6inv.cir drawn: four NDINV cells in a chain, each an
# instance of the subcircuit in mos6inv_sub.sub (pulled in by
# `.include`, with the deck's six model cards) through the generic
# `subckt6` box. Pins in `.SUBCKT NDINV 10 11 21 31 41 100` order: 1 in
# (left), 2-4 the inner stage outputs (bottom, brought out to test
# points as the deck does, so each is a one-pin net), 5 out (right),
# 6 vdd (top). Card order kept (XNDINV1-4, VDD, VIN); deck nodes 1 In,
# 2-5 N2-N5, 11-43 N11-N43, 100 Vp.
spice = 1
maxpswid = 12
In: (0.9,1.5)
N2: (2.1,1.5)
N3: (3.9,1.5)
N4: (5.7,1.5)
N5: (7.5,1.5)
Vp: (1.5,2.3)
N11: (1.2,1.1)
N12: (1.5,1.1)
N13: (1.8,1.1)
N21: (3,1.1)
N22: (3.3,1.1)
N23: (3.6,1.1)
N31: (4.8,1.1)
N32: (5.1,1.1)
N33: (5.4,1.1)
N41: (6.6,1.1)
N42: (6.9,1.1)
N43: (7.2,1.1)

XNDINV1: subckt6((0.9,1.5), (1.2,1.1), (1.5,1.1), (1.8,1.1), (2.1,1.5), (1.5,1.9), NDINV)
XNDINV2: subckt6((2.7,1.5), (3,1.1), (3.3,1.1), (3.6,1.1), (3.9,1.5), (3.3,1.9), NDINV)
XNDINV3: subckt6((4.5,1.5), (4.8,1.1), (5.1,1.1), (5.4,1.1), (5.7,1.5), (5.1,1.9), NDINV)
XNDINV4: subckt6((6.3,1.5), (6.6,1.1), (6.9,1.1), (7.2,1.1), (7.5,1.5), (6.9,1.9), NDINV)
VDD: vsource((8.7,2.3), (8.7,0), 5, "VDD")
VIN: vsource((0.3,1.5), (0.3,0), DC 0 PWL(0 0 2N 5), "G₁")

line from VIN.P to XNDINV1.P1
line from XNDINV1.P5 to XNDINV2.P1
line from XNDINV2.P5 to XNDINV3.P1
line from XNDINV3.P5 to XNDINV4.P1
line from XNDINV4.P5 to (7.9,1.5); circle rad 0.04 at (7.94,1.5)
"out" above at (7.94,1.55)
line from (1.5,2.3) to VDD.P
line from XNDINV1.P6 to (XNDINV1.P6.x,2.3)
line from XNDINV2.P6 to (XNDINV2.P6.x,2.3)
line from XNDINV3.P6 to (XNDINV3.P6.x,2.3)
line from XNDINV4.P6 to (XNDINV4.P6.x,2.3)
dot at (3.3,2.3); dot at (5.1,2.3); dot at (6.9,2.3)
line from XNDINV1.P2 to (1.2,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (1.2,0.8); "11" below at (1.2,0.76)
line from XNDINV1.P3 to (1.5,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (1.5,0.8); "12" below at (1.5,0.76)
line from XNDINV1.P4 to (1.8,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (1.8,0.8); "13" below at (1.8,0.76)
line from XNDINV2.P2 to (3,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (3,0.8); "21" below at (3,0.76)
line from XNDINV2.P3 to (3.3,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (3.3,0.8); "22" below at (3.3,0.76)
line from XNDINV2.P4 to (3.6,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (3.6,0.8); "23" below at (3.6,0.76)
line from XNDINV3.P2 to (4.8,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (4.8,0.8); "31" below at (4.8,0.76)
line from XNDINV3.P3 to (5.1,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (5.1,0.8); "32" below at (5.1,0.76)
line from XNDINV3.P4 to (5.4,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (5.4,0.8); "33" below at (5.4,0.76)
line from XNDINV4.P2 to (6.6,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (6.6,0.8); "41" below at (6.6,0.76)
line from XNDINV4.P3 to (6.9,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (6.9,0.8); "42" below at (6.9,0.76)
line from XNDINV4.P4 to (7.2,0.84); circle rad 0.04 at (7.2,0.8); "43" below at (7.2,0.76)
line from VIN.N to VDD.N
ground((4.2,0))
.include mos6inv_sub.sub
.TRAN 0.5N 150N
.PRINT TRAN V(In) V(N2) V(N3) V(N4) V(N5)
.PRINT TRAN V(N11) V(N12) V(N13) V(N41) V(N42) V(N43)
.OPTIONS ACCT
.PE
